  data: {
    LLM: "Save Aces for when the table has many cards or high-value cards you can't capture otherwise. Try to leave the table with a sum that the opponent cannot easily capture (e.g., 7 is risky because of Settebello).\n\nCounting Cards: Track whether the Settebello and other 7s have triggered the Primiera point. Don't waste an Ace sweeping 'trash' cards unless you need the card count point.\n\nThe Ace Trap: If you hold an Ace, you can bait the opponent into filling the table. Conversely, if you know the opponent has an Ace, keep the table lean to minimize their gain.",
    Player: "Save Aces for when the table has many cards or high-value cards you can't capture otherwise. Try to leave the table with a sum that the opponent cannot easily capture (e.g., 7 is risky because of Settebello).\n\nCounting Cards: Track whether the Settebello and other 7s have triggered the Primiera point. Don't waste an Ace sweeping 'trash' cards unless you need the card count point.\n\nThe Ace Trap: If you hold an Ace, you can bait the opponent into filling the table. Conversely, if you know the opponent has an Ace, keep the table lean to minimize their gain.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
